  definition:
    Id: personal_talk
    Title: A team member wants to talk about something personal
    Body: Someone asks for a word. They say it is not about work directly.
    BaseSuccessChance: 0.7
    OnAcceptSuccess:
      ProgressDelta: 0
      CredibilityDelta: 0
      DeadlineDelta: 0
      TeamFatigueDelta: 4
      TeamMoraleDelta: 12
      Text: You talked it through and they left a great deal lighter.
    OnAcceptFail:
      ProgressDelta: 0
      CredibilityDelta: -8
      DeadlineDelta: 0
      TeamFatigueDelta: 0
      TeamMoraleDelta: -6
      Text: You said the wrong thing at the wrong moment and it spread through the
        whole team.
    OnDecline:
      ProgressDelta: 0
      CredibilityDelta: 0
      DeadlineDelta: 0
      TeamFatigueDelta: 0
      TeamMoraleDelta: -8
      Text: You told them it could wait. They never came back.
